<tabber>
Melee= 
[[Melee]] is the simplest and lowest requirement style for effectively killing jellies. Using [[Protect from Melee]] will negate all damage taken. Their attacks are magic-based melee, so if you're not praying against their attacks, you'll need to wear armour that is resistant to magical attacks. Wearing armour with high magic defence (such as [[Karil's armour]] or [[black dragonhide armour]]) will suffice. Higher combat level players may find a small amount of food to suffice for fighting regular jellies (not Warped jellies) instead of using prayer.<br> <br>

The [[Ring of wealth]] may be considered as [[coins]] are a common drop, though a combat-boosting ring such as a [[berserker ring]] may be preferable for more experienced players.

