Magic= 
Jellies may be killed with [[Magic]] for the fastest possible kills in multicombat areas (particularly within the [[Catacombs of Kourend]]), by using multi-target [[Ancient Magicks]] such as [[Ice Burst]] or [[Ice Barrage]]. Using [[Protect from Melee]] to mitigate all damage taken is highly recommended.<br> <br>

[[Throwing knife|Knives]] or [[Darts]] (preferably the cheapest available, such as Bronze or Iron) are recommended for quickly tagging non-aggressive monsters to stack for multi-target spells. The [[Dinh's bulwark]], especially in combination with a [[Lightbearer]], can be used in addition to darts/knives to quickly tag many monsters even faster.

